WEBVTT

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:09.400
There are... two goddesses?

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:19.290
What do you think you're doing, Onee-sama?

00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:21.040
Onee-sama?

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:22.450
Janice!

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:25.250
Hey, listen, Janice! I sang in front of everyone!

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:28.340
You saw me too, right, Mama?

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:29.240
How was I?

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:32.410
You bet I saw it! You were amazing!

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:35.530
Oh, Jululu, you've grown up so much...

00:00:35.530 --> 00:00:36.200
Wait, no!

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:38.910
This isn't the time for a tender moment-pri!

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:39.800
That's right!

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:42.430
Um, um, er, um...

00:00:42.430 --> 00:00:44.600
I'm capisce-terical!

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:22.410
Wh–What's going on here-pri?

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:23.740
Stylish!

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:25.200
Cool!

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:26.090
Down.

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:29.460
As the official representative, I shall inquire.

00:02:29.970 --> 00:02:31.260
Goddess Jewlie...

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:33.210
It is an honour to finally see you.

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:36.780
But may I ask why you have given us this performance?

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:38.970
And just who...

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:43.150
I am the one who called you here.

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:45.210
Allow me to explain everything.

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:49.680
But before we get too far into things,

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:52.230
can something be done about her?

00:02:52.570 --> 00:02:53.980
You two phoenixes!

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:56.090
Mum said...

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:58.980
If you eat phoenix, live forever!

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:03.650
No, you can't eat goddesses!

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:05.580
When bring them down, give one to you!

00:03:06.750 --> 00:03:07.960
No! Bad Pepper!

00:03:07.960 --> 00:03:09.650
Purr, purr!

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:13.660
Returning to the matter at hand,

00:03:13.660 --> 00:03:16.000
I am Jewlie's younger sister, Janice.

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:17.460
Younger sister?

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:20.490
Say what? Jewlie has a younger sister?

00:03:21.020 --> 00:03:23.280
Your surprise is only natural.

00:03:23.280 --> 00:03:26.680
In PriPara's history, none should know of my existence.

00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:31.640
If my sister's role is to oversee the Divine Idol Grand Prix,

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:33.900
mine is to support her from the shadows.

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:36.510
Onee-sama and I...

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:39.860
are like the light and dark sides of the moon.

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:41.730
An apt metaphor.

00:03:41.730 --> 00:03:44.320
The dark side of the moon...

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:45.760
is never visible, right?

00:03:46.170 --> 00:03:49.790
Indeed, my destiny was to be eternally unseen.

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:53.470
And the fact that you appeared before us anyway

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:55.790
means something serious has happened, right-pri?

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:58.240
That's exactly right.

00:03:58.240 --> 00:03:59.410
And all of it...

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:01.760
is due to Onee-sama's capriciousness!

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:04.500
I'm not being capricious!

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:07.970
I just <i>love</i> idols, you see!

00:04:08.460 --> 00:04:09.730
For goodness's sake...

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:12.440
Your love for idols has brought nothing but trouble.

00:04:16.090 --> 00:04:17.610
Onee-sama, you've...

00:04:17.610 --> 00:04:22.000
been disguising yourself and
visiting PriParas in various ages.

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:28.240
Mama... Mi-mi...

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:30.860
I've seen all your performances so many times!

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:46.220
They were spectacular today too!

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:48.010
Onee-sama.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:49.930
Please stop going to PriPara.

00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:53.780
The duty of a goddess is to oversee idols with grace.

00:04:54.220 --> 00:04:57.650
Fraternising with the objects of your rule will disturb the order of things.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:01.360
The outfits were adorable, as well,

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:04.450
and the Making Dramas simply riveting...

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:06.910
Are you even listening to me?

00:05:08.330 --> 00:05:10.530
I want to put on show as well.

00:05:12.880 --> 00:05:14.000
With this happening...

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:18.250
I've made up my mind! I'm going to become an idol!

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:19.700
What?

00:05:20.270 --> 00:05:23.650
When I appear for the next Divine Idol Grand Prix,

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:25.460
I plan to début as an idol.

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:28.830
Come again? Wh–What in Heaven are you talking about?

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:31.930
It's unthinkable that a goddess should become an idol!

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:34.010
That's not true at all!

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:38.650
I just need to restart my goddess self from babyhood and grow up again.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:41.550
From b–babyhood?

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:44.090
Absolutely not!

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:46.980
If you do such a thing, you'll freeze the system!

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:49.740
You sure are a worrywart, Janice.

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.840
It'll be fine. It'll all work out.

00:05:51.840 --> 00:05:53.950
And if it doesn't, it'll be too late!

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:56.710
You'll become an idol too, Janice!

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:57.970
Huh...

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:00.680
Right?

00:06:00.680 --> 00:06:04.910
This will be a billion times more fun than just watching other idols!

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:08.630
Here are our PriTickets!

00:06:09.140 --> 00:06:11.330
Here, Janice, this one's yours.

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:15.130
It's inscribed with the details of our schedules

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:18.260
and the next Divine Idol Grand Prix here in Parajuku.

00:06:18.260 --> 00:06:19.490
I won't be needing it.

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:25.240
I'm supposed to be assisting with the Grand Prix; to then become a baby idol is preposterous!

00:06:25.240 --> 00:06:27.210
Commence the update process!

00:06:27.210 --> 00:06:27.820
Huh?

00:06:39.740 --> 00:06:40.710
Hey, the mic...

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:42.040
What?

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:43.670
What's going on?

00:06:47.100 --> 00:06:48.990
Come on, let's go.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:53.230
Onee-sama! You mustn't!

00:06:54.120 --> 00:06:55.510
It'll all work out!

00:07:02.800 --> 00:07:07.130
I absolutely refuse to become an idol!

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:11.980
And that's when I found Jululu...

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:14.280
I mean Jewlie, right?

00:07:14.540 --> 00:07:15.180
Yep.

00:07:15.970 --> 00:07:17.620
And Janice?

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:20.290
Prostrate yourselves and capisce!

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:22.760
Certainly!

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:23.890
Hey, pri-haps...

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:25.920
You surmise correctly.

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.610
The one Janice chose...

00:07:28.610 --> 00:07:30.050
was none other than I!

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:31.550
What?

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:33.970
Shortly after I separated from Lala,

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:36.320
the PriPara update began.

00:07:57.650 --> 00:07:59.390
<i>There's nothing to fear.</i>

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:01.230
<i>You're...</i>

00:08:01.230 --> 00:08:03.330
<i>Fate led you to pick me up.</i>

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:05.220
<i>You will henceforth be my vassal.</i>

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:06.920
<i>Eek!</i>

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:08.970
So that's what happened...

00:08:08.970 --> 00:08:12.490
In a sense, I'm the aide to a goddess's aide.

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:16.300
Which is to say that I am therefore a princess!

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:17.890
How do you pri-each <i>that</i> conclusion?

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:19.860
Lower your head when you speak to me.

00:08:22.090 --> 00:08:24.120
Pepper, time for lunch!

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:26.010
Ooh-ooh!

00:08:26.010 --> 00:08:29.530
Chiri-shan, chiri-shan, chiri-shan-shan! Chiri-shan, chiri-shan, chiri-shan-shan!

00:08:30.290 --> 00:08:31.250
Ucha!

00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:32.360
Usacha!

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:33.320
Not <i>that</i>!

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:35.800
My tummy's rumbling, too.

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:36.160
Ooh!

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:39.120
Ooh, fried breadsticks!

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:40.540
Hm?

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:41.630
Just try me-garu!

00:08:41.630 --> 00:08:42.330
Ulp.

00:08:42.340 --> 00:08:44.720
Geru!

00:08:44.720 --> 00:08:46.660
What a farce.

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:49.250
And the blame for it all lies on you, Onee-sama!

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:51.390
It's fine.

00:08:51.390 --> 00:08:54.970
The Divine Idol Grand Prix is going smoothly.

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:57.630
Onee-sama, have you forgotten?

00:08:57.630 --> 00:08:59.180
The tragedy in Sapanna.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:01.520
A tragedy in Sapanna?

00:09:02.360 --> 00:09:03.530
I'm aware of this.

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:04.730
As I recall...

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:11.400
Although the Divine Idol Grand Prix was proceeding without issue,

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:15.360
a momentary accident occurred...

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:16.530
A fatal accident.

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:25.660
Hey, I saw that statue!

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:28.570
The system is highly susceptible to such things.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:32.300
If some calamity does ensue, it's already too late.

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:36.130
All necessary steps must be followed precisely.

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:39.240
Janice's words are indeed true.

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:43.320
But if you spend all your time worrying, you won't have any fun at all!

00:09:43.320 --> 00:09:44.600
It'll all work out!

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:48.810
Honestly! You're always like this, Onee-sama!

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:53.890
No matter my warnings, you simply say "It'll be fine. It'll all work out."

00:09:53.890 --> 00:09:57.500
And when things <i>do</i> go wrong,
it becomes my job to clean it up!

00:09:58.830 --> 00:10:02.730
Because you can't keep things together, it backfires on me, the younger sister!

00:10:02.730 --> 00:10:04.660
Oh, don't be like that...

00:10:05.300 --> 00:10:09.420
Hm, this situation seems kind of familiar...

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:12.860
Hey – it's what I'm always telling you, Onee-chan!

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:14.820
Maybe it is...

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:16.550
Be more like an elder sister.

00:10:16.550 --> 00:10:18.760
Get it together!

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:19.560
Huh?

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:25.890
Someone else stuck with a useless big sister!

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:27.850
We're kindred spirits.

00:10:29.580 --> 00:10:31.160
"Useless big sister"...

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:32.690
Capisce...

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:37.000
Usacha here is the dependable little sister to her useless big brother too!

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:38.150
Usa!

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:41.260
Irresponsible big sisters are the worst!

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:43.870
Not like me. I've got it all together, ya know.

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:46.580
Your sock's falling down, Dorothy.

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:48.700
Whoa, hey.

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:50.640
You've got a good head on your shoulders, Reona.

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:53.310
I'm dependable too!

00:10:53.310 --> 00:10:56.180
You're both on another planet if you think that-pri!

00:10:56.180 --> 00:10:58.040
Pri-pri-pri-pri-pri!

00:10:58.040 --> 00:11:01.410
Having siblings or not has nothing to do with being dependable!

00:11:01.410 --> 00:11:02.090
Indeed.

00:11:03.740 --> 00:11:04.810
Anyway...

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:07.640
it would be irresponsible to leave you in charge any longer!

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:09.640
That mark of the goddess,

00:11:10.450 --> 00:11:12.520
the baton – hand it over to me.

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:14.120
What?

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:16.610
<i>I</i> will assume the role of presiding goddess,

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:18.820
and oversee the Divine Idol Grand Prix.

00:11:19.020 --> 00:11:20.400
Wait!

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:22.410
I can't do that! Not even for you, Jan—

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:23.690
You...

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:27.440
You, Onee-sama, no longer have the right to it!

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:28.730
Janice...

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:31.120
All processes must be followed to the letter.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:33.130
Capisce stop!

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:35.090
You're sisters; you shouldn't fight!

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:37.900
I know how you must feel, Janice, but...

00:11:38.660 --> 00:11:41.180
Onee-sama is not fit to perform a goddess's duties.

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:42.800
That's not true, Mama!

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:44.640
J–Jululu...

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:46.210
Jewlie...

00:11:46.210 --> 00:11:47.220
I...

00:11:47.710 --> 00:11:49.840
No matter what, I want to become an idol!

00:11:50.530 --> 00:11:52.230
I <i>love</i> idols!

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:53.300
But why...?

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:56.070
Why do you want to be an idol so badly?

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:58.050
Well...

00:11:58.050 --> 00:11:59.090
You see...

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:06.870
Again?

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:08.330
Mama!

00:12:08.940 --> 00:12:09.490
Julu–

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:19.130
Mama!

00:12:19.490 --> 00:12:20.590
Jululu...

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:25.800
Jewlie has returned to being a baby and
lost all awareness of herself as a goddess.

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:33.000
Well, how about that! You're a widdle baby, too!

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.840
Ha ha! Do you need your nappy changed?

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:37.080
Insolent girl!

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:40.070
Stuck in this form though I may be,
I am still the same goddess!

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:42.300
Look, she's crawling...

00:12:50.410 --> 00:13:00.650
Encore! Encore!

00:13:00.650 --> 00:13:02.970
Miss Jewlie's concert has now finished.

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:04.600
There will be no encore!

00:13:04.600 --> 00:13:06.840
Aw!

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:09.140
That was amazing!

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:12.480
I can't believe we got to see PriPara's goddess perform!

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:13.810
I want to see it again!

00:13:15.560 --> 00:13:19.250
There's no risk of Jululu or Janice being seen here.

00:13:19.970 --> 00:13:23.310
Everyone, relax. Have some tea in the playhouse cups.

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:26.450
Garuru loves it when she has lots of guests.

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:29.780
Mama!

00:13:30.210 --> 00:13:31.990
Want to come outside too, Janice?

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.750
I'm unable to leave this place.

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:39.710
I assume it's due to not having a baton.

00:13:41.600 --> 00:13:43.780
I'm sure I took corporeal form earlier

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:46.450
from being pulled along in Onee-sama's wake.

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:49.740
Heh, what a pity!

00:13:49.740 --> 00:13:50.430
Grr...

00:13:50.730 --> 00:13:54.370
So because you <i>don't</i> have a baton, you're stuck as a baby, then.

00:13:54.370 --> 00:13:55.290
Grr...

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:59.440
I guess Jewlie appearing was only temporary, too-kuma.

00:13:59.890 --> 00:14:01.570
If it's come to this,

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:04.460
we've no choice but to hold an emergency Meganii summit.

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:09.410
It would be best if you could attend as well, Miss Janice, and explain the situation.

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:10.090
What?

00:14:10.590 --> 00:14:11.450
Miss Chiri.

00:14:11.820 --> 00:14:13.760
Please give me the Rosette Pact.

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:15.380
Chiri.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:18.080
You needn't listen to this bespectacled dogsbody.

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:24.300
Your current duty is seize victory at the final Grand Prix.

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:25.580
Understood...

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:30.600
<i>And my chance to steal the baton will surely come.</i>

00:14:31.090 --> 00:14:33.130
Sigh...
Meganii has it hard sometimes too-kuma...

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:34.590
I understand how he feels-usa...

00:14:34.590 --> 00:14:37.230
You can lean on me if you ever need cheering up-nekon...

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:41.400
The final Grand Prix...

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:52.570
Wow, you're doing great!

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:54.580
Mama!

00:14:58.420 --> 00:14:59.520
What did...

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:01.790
you want to tell me back then?

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:07.610
If anything ever happened to you...

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:09.220
Mama!

00:15:20.610 --> 00:15:22.770
It'll work out in the end, right, Jululu?

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:26.280
I'll be there for you whatever happens.

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:32.200
Onee-chan sure has it easy.

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:35.130
We hope to
see you-ucha
You are invited to a luncheon.

00:15:35.130 --> 00:15:37.290
Hey, Usacha sent me a message.

00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:40.580
"You are invited to a luncheon"?

00:15:47.140 --> 00:15:49.470
You got Usacha's invitation too, Chiri?

00:15:50.080 --> 00:15:51.800
Precisely.

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:55.840
It did ask me to dress formally;

00:15:55.840 --> 00:15:58.450
I wonder if my usual coord is suitable.

00:15:58.450 --> 00:15:59.580
Me too!

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:00.810
Me formal dress!

00:16:02.510 --> 00:16:03.630
Pepper too?

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:08.920
Usacha! What's going on here?

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:11.680
I didn't hear I'd be dining with a beast!

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:14.720
Hm? She's not here...

00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:25.710
Here... she is!

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:28.740
What?

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:31.460
I've prepared myself for this-ucha.

00:16:32.520 --> 00:16:35.090
Pepper! I give you permission to eat me-ucha!

00:16:35.090 --> 00:16:36.550
Ooh-ooh!

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:38.260
Usacha!

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:41.230
However, there is but one condition-ucha!

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:43.190
Huh? What condition?

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:46.330
The three of you have to form the greatest team –

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:47.770
that's the condition-ucha!

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:48.970
What?

00:16:48.970 --> 00:16:51.360
Usacha, you still haven't given up on that?

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:54.320
Ooh-ooh! Then me make team!

00:16:55.410 --> 00:17:00.290
Usacha's going to fly off to Heaven
before we can become Divine Idols!

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:02.250
That's fine with me-ucha!

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:08.340
If you can make the greatest team together, then...

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:09.390
I'll...

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:12.420
gladly be eaten-ucha!

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:14.430
Usacha...

00:17:15.070 --> 00:17:19.440
Be that as it may, I simply <i>refuse</i> to be on a team with Pepper.

00:17:19.440 --> 00:17:20.600
Good day to you all!

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:22.890
Wait, Chiri.

00:17:23.330 --> 00:17:24.370
Janice...

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:28.510
To put one's own body on the line for the sake of one's team...

00:17:29.100 --> 00:17:32.140
I've seen numerous managers throughout many ages,

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:34.140
but none quite like you.

00:17:34.140 --> 00:17:36.890
Why do you go so far for these three?

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:39.370
I received a vision-ucha!

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:42.580
These three are rock-paper-scissors-ucha!

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:46.970
No matter what rival they face,
they can throw the winning move-ucha!

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:49.120
And that's not all-ucha!

00:17:49.120 --> 00:17:54.280
Chiri is paper-ucha. I'm sure she'll be able to envelop Pepper, who's rock-ucha!

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:56.100
<i>What</i>?

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:58.180
Wh–What an odious concept!

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:01.180
To merely touch is repulsive – to <i>envelop</i>...

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:06.690
Janice-san! If you want to make Chiri into a Divine Idol, believe in me-ucha!

00:18:06.690 --> 00:18:10.440
I know these three can become the greatest team of all-ucha!

00:18:11.260 --> 00:18:12.270
Well.

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:15.360
If you're so confident, then by all means form this team.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:16.480
What?

00:18:16.480 --> 00:18:18.250
Okay! I'll do my best-ucha!

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:19.550
What?

00:18:20.020 --> 00:18:23.580
Me save you for last until we make a team.

00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:24.490
Eh?

00:18:24.890 --> 00:18:26.990
Make do with snail today!

00:18:30.130 --> 00:18:32.740
Cease immediately! I am <i>not</i> a snail!

00:18:32.740 --> 00:18:34.730
I have no eyes or stalks!

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:35.440
Tastes bad!

00:18:35.870 --> 00:18:40.140
Then, as our leader, Non –
put on a show-stopping performance right now!

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:42.240
O–Okay, then...

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:55.040
Scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:18:56.340 --> 00:18:58.170
Starting the Coord Change!

00:18:59.960 --> 00:19:03.120
It's the Lovely Coord from the Rosette Jewel brand!

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:06.460
The bouffant silhouette is resplendent in its adorable flower image!

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:08.600
Triangle Lovely Coord!

00:19:08.600 --> 00:19:09.800
Kano-pero!

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:54.220
Ju!

00:19:54.220 --> 00:19:54.500
Kano-pero!

00:19:54.500 --> 00:19:55.060
Pipi!

00:19:55.380 --> 00:19:58.690
Making Drama, switch on!

00:20:00.490 --> 00:20:01.600
Zoom!

00:20:03.390 --> 00:20:06.720
Hm? Ehe! Swoosh!

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:09.440
Let's go! Yeah!

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:10.770
Everyone together!

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:13.780
Everyone join hands!

00:20:13.780 --> 00:20:16.650
Secret wonderful scope!

00:20:18.180 --> 00:20:21.450
Super Cyalume Change!

00:20:25.720 --> 00:20:25.920
Ju!

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:26.240
Pipi!

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:27.330
Kano-pero!

00:20:41.180 --> 00:20:42.490
Oh, sacré bleu!

00:20:42.490 --> 00:20:44.370
To think such a thing could happen!

00:20:44.370 --> 00:20:46.780
Jewlie has become an idol?

00:20:46.780 --> 00:20:50.520
And on top of that, to say her younger sister Janice has appeared!

00:20:50.520 --> 00:20:52.430
What a disaster this is!

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:56.600
I believe a goddess should not act so wantonly!

00:20:56.600 --> 00:20:58.900
This must be addressed immediately!

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:03.250
Hold your horses, buddy. Our duty is to protect idols.

00:21:03.250 --> 00:21:06.610
Therefore, if Jewlie wishes to be an idol,
we have a duty to protect her.

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:10.450
I just hope the tragedy of Sapanna is not repeated-pri.

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:13.160
This is gettin' nowhere fast, y'all.

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:15.950
I suppose we'll have...

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:20.420
we'll ask the opinion of the Meganii from Parajuku, where the events in question take place.

00:21:21.410 --> 00:21:22.300
Thank you.

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:30.100
First of all, I apologise for calling you all here today.

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:31.290
However...

00:21:31.800 --> 00:21:35.130
I wonder if hurrying towards a conclusion

00:21:35.130 --> 00:21:36.730
is really of utmost importance?

00:21:38.030 --> 00:21:39.160
What?

00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:42.590
We live in an age where we all live life in the fast lane.

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:47.080
I wonder if we're forgetting something very important.

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:50.770
We should all remember to stop and smell the roses.

00:21:51.310 --> 00:21:53.720
To listen to the gentle song of the wind.

00:21:54.490 --> 00:21:57.500
There is something vital I wish to give voice to!

00:21:57.500 --> 00:21:58.730
Stylish!

00:21:59.780 --> 00:22:02.540
Pro–cras–ti–na–tion.

00:22:03.100 --> 00:22:04.270
Procrastination.

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:07.050
What can be done today can be done tomorrow instead.

00:22:07.640 --> 00:22:09.970
Let us take life as it comes, without concern for the future.

00:22:10.240 --> 00:22:19.580
Procrastination! Procrastination!

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:19.980
Procras...

00:23:52.990 --> 00:23:56.970
All fright! It's time for Halloween in PriPara, with a pumpkin castle!

00:23:56.970 --> 00:23:59.490
I'm gonna scare you up heaps!

00:23:59.490 --> 00:24:00.970
Don't make light of Halloween!

00:24:00.970 --> 00:24:01.880
Fr-eek!

00:24:01.880 --> 00:24:04.570
Your machinations are not the least bit frightening!

00:24:04.570 --> 00:24:06.830
It's way cuter than scary!

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:09.340
Darkness! Leave it our capable hands!

00:24:09.340 --> 00:24:11.340
We'll all help you!

00:24:11.340 --> 00:24:13.440
We'll scare them good and put on a show!

00:24:13.440 --> 00:24:16.880
Next time, <i>Look Fear, Look Scare, It's Hallomageddon!</i>

00:24:16.880 --> 00:24:19.850
Aim to be a Divine Idol! Let's go, PriPara!
